@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# Substitua pelos UUIDs gerados nos scripts anteriores ou use o 99_full_e2e_workflow.http
@coachId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@playerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@matchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Dashboard Analítico Web (Modo Demonstração inicial sem parâmetros)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

### 2. Dashboard Analítico Web Autenticado (Atleta + Partida + Comparativo Set 1 vs Set 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/dashboard?actor_id={{coachId}}&player_id={{playerId}}&match_id={{matchId}}
Accept: text/html

### 3. Tela Touch-First de Quadra do Treinador (21 Golpes do Padel + Thumb Zone + Undo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/court?actor_id={{coachId}}&player_id={{playerId}}&match_id={{matchId}}
Accept: text/html

### 4. Parcial HTMX: Drill-Down Recursivo do Painel Analítico (Ex.: Set 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/partials/analytics?actor_id={{coachId}}&player_id={{playerId}}&match_id={{matchId}}&set_number=1
Accept: text/html

### 5. Parcial HTMX: Modo Comparativo Lado a Lado (Set 1 vs Set 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web/partials/compare?actor_id={{coachId}}&player_id={{playerId}}&match_id={{matchId}}&set_a=1&set_b=2
Accept: text/html

### 6. Parcial HTMX: Registrar Golpe em Quadra (Formulário Touch-First)
POST {{baseUrl}}/web/partials/court/shot
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

actor_id={{coachId}}&player_id={{playerId}}&match_id={{matchId}}&set_number=1&shot_type=vibora&outcome=hit&decision=good&special_tag=winner

### 7. Parcial HTMX: Desfazer Última Jogada em Quadra (Undo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/web/partials/court/undo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

actor_id={{coachId}}&match_id={{matchId}}
